    "notes": "Inspected current noon/late, economy/high, whole silhouettes, architectural detail, all four authored levels and transitions. The low grouped roofs and detached northern gate remain readable; skyline simplifies lattice, crests, lions and pagoda tiers while preserving both real doorway voids and the compound layout. Close levels retain curved eaves, roof texture, framed lattice and facade ornaments. Flat library stages expose terrain-relative footings; the retained native six-meter hillside and source terrain views carry contact judgment. Native fixture green fallback ground and procedural neighbors are host context, not claims about actual paving or neighboring facade appearance.",
