    "notes": "Exact-QID way192187333 and main PMTiles building35184564276165 fix the 38.6 by 25.1-meter main compound outline and 8.2-meter height tag. Building35185722933384 about31m north supplies the separate gate/pavilion control. Native east/south at heading0, internal architectural angle+1.472357881276 radians. Ordinary west-side photographs resolve the viewed facade direction toward local+v. Only those two native shells are replaced, with a2cm numeric mask margin; all683 independent in-tile buildings remain byte-equivalent at every loaded level. Preserve native ground and water, using separately sampled buried foundations for each hall/gate/pagoda/lion and open native-grade inner courts. Four loaded levels retain683 native buildings; failed loading retains all685 originals; unloading restores ground/water and releases geometry."
