    "notes": "Accepted medium-fi exterior visualization from three inspected ordinary pictures and standard PMTiles/Mapzen data. Hall allocation and subdivisions inside the broad main outline, court dimensions, roof heights/profiles, pagoda center and seven-tier10.8m form, terrace/threshold engineering, lion anatomy and ridge figures remain explicit visual approximations. Coarse six-meter terrain does not resolve actual paving or low retaining walls; some platforms and approach steps are exaggerated by this grade approximation. Fine lettering, exact inscriptions, furnishings, incense coils, individual ceramic figures, trees and event trussing are omitted. Physical-device and dense-city timings remain pending."
